          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, Judaeo-Turkish section",
          "value": "\n\n<ol><li>door-keeper \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 3__(thirty-___)</li>\n<li>\u2026]eyzg\u012br/-eyzk\u012br(?)\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a04__ (four\u00a0 ___ )</li>\n<li>\u2026] (an eye) intently fixed toward the inside, bring it together, touch[ing]/touch slightly with an arrow [...</li>\n<li>...] ... it is (together) as one, unless your inability(?) [...] ask,</li>\n<li>\u2026] ... become acquainted to blood (from) [...], touch the thumb-stall onto it\u2026\u00a0</li></ol>\n\n\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
